{"id":"00331","root":"uni00331_1","name":{"ja":"ミレイユ","en":"Mireille"},"title":{"ja":"【夢の中で】","en":"【In a Dream】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【夢の中で】 ミレイユ","en":"【In a Dream】 Mireille"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-05-15","limited":true,"characterId":143,"profile":{"ja":"リリムと同じ夢魔。落ちこぼれのリリムと違い、人魔問わず多くの者を虜にする優秀なサキュバスとして名が通っている。二人の仲は良いわけではなく……どちらかと言えば悪い。ミレイユはリリムを夢魔の恥さらしだと言って高圧的に接し、リリムは口うるさい彼女に辟易している。ある時リリムが人間界にいると知ったミレイユは、嫌な予感から彼女の様子を探る。すると案の定彼女はヤタガラスの化身を名乗る怪しげな魔族や、さらには対魔忍などと慣れ合い、イタズラと小銭稼ぎを繰り返す日々を送っていた。その体たらくに激怒したミレイユはリリムにお灸を据えるため、そしてリリムとつるむ者たちに本当のサキュバスの恐ろしさを思い知らせるため、人間界を訪れる。","en":"Mireille is a succubus of the same type as Lilim. Unlike the wayward Lilim, she is renowned as an outstanding succubus who captivates countless beings, human and demon alike. Their relationship isn't exactly friendly… if anything, it's hostile. Mireille treats Lilim condescendingly, calling her a disgrace to dream demons, while Lilim is fed up with her nagging sister. When Mireille learns that Lilim is in the Human Realm, a bad feeling prompts her to investigate. As expected, Lilim spends her days fraternizing with shady demon-type shapeshifters who call themselves the incarnation of Yatagarasu, as well as with Taimanin, pulling pranks and making pocket money. Enraged by Lilim's behavior, Mireille decides to visit the Human Realm to give Lilim a proper lesson and to show everyone who hangs out with Lilim the true terror of a real succubus."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"かりんとうか","forms":[{"id":"uni00331_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1036,2072],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[144,288],"def":[112,224],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["3","580001"],"evolve":[["evo00007",5],["evo00008",15],["evo00009",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00331_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1572,3144],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[223,446],"def":[159,318],"spd":[74,74],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":4